# D-Card API — contributions (michango)
# docs/design/features/contributions.md. D-Card only records payments made outside it (M-Pesa, bank, cash…).
# Host + committee add contributors; host + treasurers record payments and edit pledges; all three see amounts.
# This file runs as the host. To try committee/treasurer tokens, grant the roles first with 06-team.http.
# Rules on every payment: (1) auto-upgrade Single → Double before issue when paid ≥ Double amount
# (Kawaida/Premium with the event setting on), then (2) auto-issue the card when paid ≥ pledge.


### Setup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{committeeToken}}

### Setup: Kawaida event with card amounts and a budget
# @name event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planKey": "kawaida", "eventTypeKey": "wedding", "title": "Michango demo", "startsAt": "2026-12-12T15:00:00+03:00", "contactName": "Asha", "contactPhone": "0754123456", "singleAmount": 50000, "doubleAmount": 100000, "budgetAmount": 3000000 }

> {%
  client.global.set("eventId", response.body.id);
%}

### Add a contributor with a pledge (host, committee)
# Body: name, phone, cardType?, partnerName?, amount (whole TZS 1–100,000,000), consent: true.
# Reuses the invitation when the phone is already a guest (GST-2); one pledge per invitation.
# 201 → { "pledge": Pledge, "existingGuest": bool } · 409 already has a pledge · 422 consent_required / validation · 403 treasurer.
# Pledge: { id, guestId, name, phone, partnerName, cardType, amountPledged, amountPaid, amountExtra, balance,
#   status: not_paid|part_paid|fully_paid, upgradedAt, invitationStatus: pending|issued|cancelled, cardNumber }
# @name salum
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mzee Salum", "phone": "0713 500 001", "cardType": "single", "amount": 50000, "consent": true }

> {%
  client.global.set("salumPledge", response.body.pledge.id);
%}

### Record a part payment (host, treasurer)
# Body: amount (positive), method: mpesa|mixx_by_yas|airtel_money|halopesa|bank|cash|other, reference?, paidOn (YYYY-MM-DD), kind? payment|refund.
# 201 → { "pledge": Pledge, "payment": Payment { id, kind, amount (signed), method, reference, paidOn, recordedBy, recordedAt } }
# 403 committee · 422 validation.
# @name firstPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 20000, "method": "mpesa", "reference": "QX12AB", "paidOn": "2026-10-01" }

> {%
  client.global.set("firstPaymentId", response.body.payment.id);
%}

### Final payment → card issued automatically (pledge.invitationStatus "issued", cardNumber set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 30000, "method": "cash", "paidOn": "2026-10-05" }

### More than the pledge → the rest is an extra contribution (card unchanged)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10000, "method": "mpesa", "paidOn": "2026-10-06" }

### Refund (recorded as a negative payment; card stays issued)
# 422 if the refund is more than the amount paid.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "refund", "amount": 10000, "method": "cash", "reference": "Returned in cash", "paidOn": "2026-10-07" }

### Correct a payment record (host, treasurer; audited with old/new values)
# Any of amount, method, reference, paidOn. Totals and card issue are recomputed.
# 200 → { pledge, payment } · 404 unknown payment.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/payments/{{firstPaymentId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reference": "QX12AB-FIXED" }

### Auto-upgrade: one payment of the Double amount on a Single pledge → Double card
# @name upgrade
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bw. Kassim", "phone": "0713500002", "amount": 50000, "consent": true }

> {%
  client.global.set("upgradePledgeId", response.body.pledge.id);
%}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{upgradePledgeId}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100000, "method": "bank", "reference": "CRDB-7781", "paidOn": "2026-10-02" }

### Edit a pledge before the card is issued (host, treasurer)
# Any of amount, cardType. Issues the card at once if payments already cover the new amount. 409 after issue.
# @name rehema
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rehema", "phone": "0713500003", "cardType": "double", "partnerName": "Hamisi", "amount": 100000, "consent": true }

> {%
  client.global.set("rehemaPledgeId", response.body.pledge.id);
%}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{rehemaPledgeId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 80000 }

### Pledge edit after issue → 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 70000 }

### Committee cannot record payments → 403
# (403 with or without the committee role; roles are granted in 06-team.http.)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}/payments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{committeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1000, "method": "cash", "paidOn": "2026-10-08" }

### One contributor with payment history (host, committee, treasurer)
# 200 → { "pledge": Pledge, "payments": [Payment…] } (oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/pledges/{{salumPledge}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Dashboard: totals and contributors (host, committee, treasurer)
# Query: status not_paid|part_paid|fully_paid|cancelled, q (name or phone digits).
# 200 → { "summary": { pledged, collected, outstanding, extras, refunds, budget, counts: { not_paid, part_paid, fully_paid, cancelled } }, "contributors": [Pledge] }
# Cancelled cards leave pledged/outstanding, but their payments still count in collected.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions?status=part_paid
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Export for committee meetings (CON-10): CSV (UTF-8 with BOM) or Excel
# Column headers follow the caller's language cookie (NEXT_LOCALE, default sw).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions/export?format=csv
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Cookie: NEXT_LOCALE={{locale}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/contributions/export?format=xlsx
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Cookie: NEXT_LOCALE={{locale}}
